# Bongus Trading Bot Agent Memory Router

This repository implements a delta-neutral funding rate arbitrage trading system targeting Binance perpetual futures against spot.

Before working on a specific domain, load the corresponding instruction files:

- **Rust Execution Engine**: Load [.agents/rust_engine.md](file:///mnt/data/bongus_trading_bot/.agents/rust_engine.md) for order manager state machine, legging defense, collateral engine, and REST/WS binance modules.
- **Python Execution & Strategy**: Load [.agents/python_execution.md](file:///mnt/data/bongus_trading_bot/.agents/python_execution.md) for strategy signals (Polars-only), portfolio allocator sizing, state writes, and risk limit evaluations.
- **ZMQ & Telemetry messaging**: Load [.agents/zmq_messaging.md](file:///mnt/data/bongus_trading_bot/.agents/zmq_messaging.md) for ZMQ instruction PUSH (Port 5555) and TCP telemetry broadcast PULL (Port 9000).

## Core Operation Rules
- **Tmux Execution Constraint**: Always run Bongus within a `tmux` session/window. If changes are made requiring a system restart, restart the bot inside the `tmux` session.
